"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியோ","tr":"ḻiyō"}]},{"text":"வருந்துதும்","tr":"varuntutum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வருந்","tr":"varun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துதும்","tr":"tutum"}]},{"text":"யாமே","tr":"yāmē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கருங்கண்","parts":[{"text":"கருமை","lemma":"கருமை","gloss":"blackness"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"black-eyed"},{"surface":"தாக்கலை","parts":[{"text":"தாக்கலை","lemma":"தாக்கலை","gloss":"male monkey"}],"gloss":"male monkey"},{"surface":"பெரும்பிறிது","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"greatness"},{"text":"பிறிது","lemma":"பிறிது","gloss":"other/death"}],"gloss":"great departure (death)"},{"surface":"உற்றெனக்","parts":[{"text":"உற்று","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"having experienced"},{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"as/because"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"sandhi consonant"}],"gloss":"because it attained"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கைம்மை","parts":[{"text":"கைம்மை","lemma":"கைம்மை","gloss":"widowhood"}],"gloss":"widowhood"},{"surface":"உய்யா","parts":[{"text":"உய்","lemma":"உய்","gloss":"to escape/survive"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"not escaping/surviving"},{"surface":"காமர்","parts":[{"text":"காமர்","lemma":"காமர்","gloss":"desirable/loving"}],"gloss":"loving"},{"surface":"மந்தி","parts":[{"text":"மந்தி","lemma":"மந்தி","gloss":"female monkey"}],"gloss":"female monkey"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கல்லா","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"to learn"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"unlearned/immature"},{"surface":"வன்பறழ்","parts":[{"text":"வன்பறழ்","lemma":"வன்பறழ்","gloss":"strong young cub"}],"gloss":"strong young cub","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கிளைமுதல்","parts":[{"text":"கிளை","lemma":"கிளை","gloss":"branch"},{"text":"முதல்","lemma":"முதல்","gloss":"base/fork"}],"gloss":"fork of a branch"},{"surface":"சேர்த்தி","parts":[{"text":"சேர்","lemma":"சேர்","gloss":"to reach/join"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"causative marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having placed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓங்குவரை","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்கு","lemma":"ஓங்கு","gloss":"to rise high"},{"text":"வரை","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"high mountain"},{"surface":"அடுக்கத்து","parts":[{"text":"அடுக்கு","lemma":"அடுக்கு","gloss":"mountain cleft/slope"},{"text":"அத்து","lemma":"அத்து","gloss":"inflectional increment"}],"gloss":"from the mountain cleft"},{"surface":"பாய்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"பாய்","lemma":"பாய்","gloss":"to leap"},{"text":"ந்து","lemma":"ந்து","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having leaped"},{"surface":"உயிர்","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"},{"surface":"செகுக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"செகு","lemma":"செகு","gloss":"to destroy"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"future marker"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"sandhi consonant"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual/relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"will destroy"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சாரல்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"சாரல்","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"},{"surface":"நாட","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"vocative suffix"}],"gloss":"O lord of the land!"},{"surface":"நடுநாள்","parts":[{"text":"நடு","lemma":"நடு","gloss":"middle"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day/night"}],"gloss":"at midnight"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாரல்","parts":[{"text":"வாரல்","lemma":"வாரல்","gloss":"do not come"}],"gloss":"do not come","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாழியோ","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழி","gloss":"may you live"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"address particle"}],"gloss":"may you live long!"},{"surface":"வருந்துதும்","parts":[{"text":"வருந்து","lemma":"வருந்து","gloss":"to suffer/worry"},{"text":"தும்","lemma":"தும்","gloss":"first-person plural suffix"}],"gloss":"we suffer"},{"surface":"யாமே","parts":[{"text":"யாம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"we"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"we indeed"}]}],"literal":"Black-eyed male monkey great departure having attained, / widowhood not escaping loving female monkey, / unlearned strong young cub at the fork of a branch having placed, / rising-high mountain cleft having leaped, life destroys, / O lord of the slope land! At midnight / do not come, may you live! We suffer, we indeed.","translation":"When her black-eyed male monkey dies, the loving female monkey, unable to survive her widowhood, leaves her young, untaught cub at the fork of a branch, and leaps from the high mountain cleft to end her life. O lord of such mountain slopes! Do not come at midnight. May you live long! We only suffer in anxiety for you.","modern":"கரிய கண்களை உடைய ஆண் குரங்கு இறந்துவிட்டதால், கைம்மைத் துயரத்தைத் தாங்க முடியாத அன்பான பெண் குரங்கு, தன் அறிவில்லாத குட்டியை மரக்கிளையின் கவட்டிலே சேர்த்துவிட்டு, உயர்ந்த மலையின் அடுக்கிலிருந்து குதித்துத் தன் உயிரை மாய்த்துக் கொள்ளும். அத்தகைய மலைச்சாரல் நாட்டுத் தலைவனே! நடு இரவில் நீ எங்களை நாடி வர வேண்டாம். நீ டூழி வாழ்க! உனது ஆபத்தான பயணத்தை நினைத்து நாங்கள் வருந்துகிறோம்.","explanation":"The companion (tōḻi) speaks to the hero (talaivaṉ) who has been coming secretly at midnight to meet the heroine (talaivi). She describes the mountain slopes of his land, where a female monkey, unable to endure the death of her mate, leaves her young cub safely on a branch and leaps to her death. This poignant image of the monkey's devotion and tragic end serves as an implied metaphor (ullurai), warning the hero of the dangers of his nightly journeys. The companion implies that if anything happens to him on his perilous path, the heroine will not survive either, just like the devoted female monkey. By wishing him well ('vāḻiyō') while asking him not to come at night ('vāral'), she urges him to seek a formal public marriage instead of secret trysts.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.3,2.5],[2.5,2.8],[2.8,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,4.3],[4.3,4.8],[4.8,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,7.2],[7.2,7.38],[7.38,8.3],[8.3,9.05],[9.05,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.0],[10.0,11.2],[11.2,11.7],[11.7,12.22],[12.22,12.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.75,1.95],[1.95,2.4],[2.4,3.0],[3.0,3.45],[3.45,3.9],[3.9,4.9],[4.9,5.4],[5.4,6.3],[6.3,6.7],[6.7,7.7],[7.7,7.89],[7.89,8.9],[8.9,9.71],[9.71,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,10.8],[10.8,12.2],[12.2,12.7],[12.7,13.22],[13.22,13.4]]},"sync":[[["கருங்கண்","black-eyed"]],[["தாக்கலை","male monkey"]],[["பெரும்பிறிது","great departure (death)"]],[["பெரும்பிறிது","great departure (death)"],["உற்றெனக்","because it attained"]],[["கைம்மை","widowhood"]],[["உய்யா","not escaping/surviving"],["காமர்","loving"]],[["காமர்","loving"]],[["மந்தி","female monkey"]],[["கல்லா","unlearned/immature"]],[["வன்பறழ்","strong young cub"]],[["கிளைமுதல்","fork of a branch"]],[["சேர்த்தி","having placed"]],[["ஓங்குவரை","high mountain"]],[["அடுக்கத்து","from the mountain cleft"],["பாய்ந்து","having leaped"]],[["பாய்ந்து","having leaped"],["உயிர்","life"]],[["செகுக்கும்","will destroy"]],[["சாரல்","mountain slope"]],[["நாட","O lord of the land!"]],[["நடுநாள்","at midnight"]],[["வாரல்","do not come"]],[["வாழியோ","may you live long!"]],[["வருந்துதும்","we suffer"]],[["யாமே","we indeed"]]]}